          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Your hands make it. The app walks you through every step.</p><p>Upload any photo and the app turns it into a real-time, voice-guided sequence that flows at your pace — no diagrams to decode, no wrong moves to undo, no buttons to tap between lines. You, the thread, and the next number.</p>",
